     1,
     "<div dir=\"auto\">Thanks for your help,<div dir=\"auto\">For being more accurate and precise, I am using Distance 7.4 for Microsoft </div><div dir=\"auto\">I am able to design for a study area with one strata, but my study area is stratified in 7 stratum.It&#39;s a REDD+ Concession; but we&#39;ll focus our surveys on 4stratum.</div><div dir=\"auto\">A tutorial of more than one strata will be helpfull for us.</div><div dir=\"auto\">Regards,</div><div dir=\"auto\">Tsakala </div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div></div>"
