     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Thanks for your help,\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">For being more accurate and precise, I am using Distance 7.4 for Microsoft </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">I am able to design for a study area with one strata, but my study area is stratified in 7 stratum.It&#39;s a REDD+ Concession; but we&#39;ll focus our surveys on 4stratum.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">A tutorial of more than one strata will be helpfull for us.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Regards,</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Tsakala </div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Le sam. 4 mars 2023 à 12:05, Eric Rexstad &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Eric.R...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a>&gt; a écrit :<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nTsakalambutu</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nWe have a tutorial for a multiple stratum survey using the R package <code>dssd</code>​ you can follow at this link:</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<a href=\"http://examples.distancesampling.org/dssd-multi-strata/MultiStrataVignette-distill.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://examples.distancesampling.org/dssd-multi-strata/MultiStrataVignette-distill.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472308166000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DZyXKEi-TyD-DpzfLUNhy\">http://examples.distancesampling.org/dssd-multi-strata/MultiStrataVignette-distill.html</a><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;max-width:800px;min-width:424px\">\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:12px 36px 12px 12px;width:100%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(200,200,200);border-radius:2px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"border-spacing:0px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<td style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:300;margin-right:8px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px\">\r\n<a href=\"http://examples.distancesampling.org/dssd-multi-strata/MultiStrataVignette-distill.html\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://examples.distancesampling.org/dssd-multi-strata/MultiStrataVignette-distill.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472308166000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DZyXKEi-TyD-DpzfLUNhy\">Multiple Strata in dssd</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;max-height:100px;color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px;margin-right:8px;overflow:hidden\">\r\nDesigning distance sampling surveys containing more than one stratum.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:rgb(166,166,166);font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif\">\r\n<a href=\"http://examples.distancesampling.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://examples.distancesampling.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472308166000&amp;usg=AOvVaw123Zvo7-YOTq4IssrfvhJY\">examples.distancesampling.org</a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nIf you wish to use Distance for Windows, there are examples for both single and two strata. They can be found in Chapter 3, Getting Started of the Distance Users Guide.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nIf you need more assistance after consulting these, please get back in touch.<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font style=\"font-size:11pt\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b>\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\ndistance...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; on behalf of\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\ntsakal...@gmail.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tsakal...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> 04 March 2023 10:41<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> distance-sampling &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [distance-sampling] Request</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Hi everyone;\r\n<div>I would like to get a help about designing a sampling plan of a study area stratified in 5 strata. In fact; I want to make transects of one kilometer randomly and systematically for ecological survey.</div>\r\n<div>Is there any one who can help with a tutorial?</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Kind regards</div>\r\n<p></p>\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;distance-sampling&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\ndistance-sampl...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/distance-sampling/c88d6f24-9d80-4092-b289-c8375b3c5612n%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/distance-sampling/c88d6f24-9d80-4092-b289-c8375b3c5612n%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472308166000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-G9zjVehQhxKYN98MvNaN\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/distance-sampling/c88d6f24-9d80-4092-b289-c8375b3c5612n%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>"
    ]
